11
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:41.040
Hello, and welcome to the finale of Season 6, Whistleblower, also Episode 26.

12
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.400
This was such a big season.

13
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.420
It was crazy.

14
00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.920
