36
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.920
It is one sentence long, but I think it really

37
00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:35.600
sums it up.

38
00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:36.020
Okay.

39
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:43.040
An angry Joe Bennett descends upon Dunder Mifflin Scranton to identify which employee talked to

40
00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:48.740
