142
00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:47.600
I noticed one.

143
00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:48.660
What did you notice?

144
00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.620
Are those Joe's initials?

145
00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.720
There's, like, a little fancy-looking,

