00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.520
I don't know what you call it.

147
00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.740
It goes over the chair, like, for your head.

148
00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:57.060
Yes.

149
00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:57.920
Like a cloth.

150
00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:58.740
Yes.

151
00:06:58.980 --> 00:06:59.920
What are those called?

152
00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.160
I don't know what they're called.

153
00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.640
They're, like, they're on the headreSt.

154
00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.280
Like a doily for an airplane.

155
00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:04.940
Yes.

156
00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:12.340
They were little cloths on the headrest, and they were embroidered with JB for Joe Bennett.

157
00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.300
That was my question.

158
00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.900
I was going to say, is that real embroidery?

159
00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:15.860
Because it looked fancy.

160
00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.360
Oh, yeah.

161
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:17.280
He had those made.

