164
00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:31.720
Oh, so cool.

165
00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.000
Like, she signed the outside of her plane.

166
00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.220
I love little details like that.

167
00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:36.620
Mm-hmm.

168
00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:37.300
All right.

